WEBVTT

01:40.240 --> 01:42.240
Hold still, you little...

01:42.240 --> 01:45.560
Just accept that you're 
no match for me and surrender.

01:45.560 --> 01:48.040
I'll make sure it doesn't hurt!

01:48.720 --> 01:50.650
Why are you trying to erase me?

01:50.650 --> 01:52.490
Because you're a demon.

01:52.490 --> 01:54.550
Dude, that's it?

01:54.550 --> 01:59.050
Also, there's a stray dog 
attacking women in this area lately.

01:59.050 --> 02:00.860
That's you, isn't it?

02:01.430 --> 02:04.060
I'll tell you if you can defeat me.

02:04.060 --> 02:08.520
No one has ever dared to face my true form!

02:09.360 --> 02:10.040
Oh?

02:10.040 --> 02:11.560
I can't wait.

02:11.560 --> 02:13.610
Beware...

02:13.610 --> 02:17.360
In this form, my power, my intellect...

02:17.360 --> 02:20.910
It's all 50% off from that of my beast form!

02:22.620 --> 02:24.910
<i>Your ability's gone down.</i>

02:24.910 --> 02:29.080
I see you're so terrified by my power-up 
that you're at a loss for words.

02:29.080 --> 02:31.030
None could blame you.

02:31.030 --> 02:32.080
For the very sight of my—

02:35.050 --> 02:37.470
What's with that skimpy costume?!

02:37.470 --> 02:39.200
It's so random and cringey!

02:39.200 --> 02:40.170
Fool!

02:40.170 --> 02:43.050
But my body went into summer mode...

02:45.850 --> 02:48.170
I worry about you in more ways than one.

02:48.170 --> 02:50.600
Thank you.

02:50.600 --> 02:52.690
H-Hey, shouldn't you be hiding?

02:52.690 --> 02:56.910
Hold on. Are you an angel, too?

02:56.910 --> 02:58.650
No, you aren't...

02:58.650 --> 03:00.780
You're one of my kind.

03:00.780 --> 03:03.310
What are you doing with an angel?

03:03.310 --> 03:05.280
Umm...

03:05.280 --> 03:06.590
A traitor!

03:06.590 --> 03:09.500
No, there's a reason for this!

03:09.500 --> 03:10.810
I don't want to hear it.

03:10.810 --> 03:12.170
No, please, hear me out!

03:12.170 --> 03:14.030
Fine.

03:14.030 --> 03:16.440
But before we talk,

03:16.440 --> 03:18.510
attack that woman.

03:18.510 --> 03:19.720
I can't...

03:20.720 --> 03:22.410
That's enough.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.410
Out of the way.

03:24.410 --> 03:28.540
Interfere any further, 
and I'll exorcise you, too.

03:28.970 --> 03:30.620
Hang on, both of you!

03:30.620 --> 03:32.380
You've forgotten something important!

03:32.380 --> 03:33.260
What?

03:33.260 --> 03:34.400
Listen up, guys.

03:34.400 --> 03:37.900
You need to calm down and talk it out 
before you resort to violence.

03:38.270 --> 03:41.430
About the past, and about the future.

03:41.980 --> 03:42.910
Yes...

03:42.910 --> 03:44.280
<b>Mash the button to
complete the heart!</b>

03:42.910 --> 03:45.690
Mash the button and complete the heart!

03:44.280 --> 03:48.790
<b>Push</b>

03:49.910 --> 03:53.830
Hold love in your heart.

03:50.200 --> 03:53.830
<b>Hold
love</b>

03:52.250 --> 03:53.830
<b>in
your
heart</b>

03:53.790 --> 03:55.670
<b>Bonus confirmed!</b>

03:53.830 --> 03:55.670
Bonus confirmed!

03:56.970 --> 04:00.170
You aren't bad for a fool's acquaintance!

04:00.170 --> 04:02.970
Nor are you, for a fool's kind!

04:04.130 --> 04:06.680
You make me laugh, speaking of a demon's love!

04:06.680 --> 04:09.870
Speaking of love is the task of 
fools and angels, is it not?

04:09.870 --> 04:11.230
I don't have time for that now!

04:11.230 --> 04:12.270
Neither do I!

04:13.140 --> 04:14.400
All right...

04:14.400 --> 04:17.150
If you both so insist, I'll let you both feel...

04:17.150 --> 04:19.960
my love.

04:20.400 --> 04:21.190
<b>Slightly
embarrassed</b>

04:23.600 --> 04:28.120
If the power of love will reach your heart,

04:23.780 --> 04:32.040
<b>If the power of love will
reach your heart, I wish you
would stop this fighting</b>

04:28.120 --> 04:32.040
I wish you would stop this fighting.

04:32.040 --> 04:35.100
Now, please, let us hear how you feel!

04:35.100 --> 04:36.620
<i>I'm not doing anything.</i>

04:36.620 --> 04:38.570
<i>This kid's a real piece of—</i>

04:38.570 --> 04:40.590
<i>She actually took the mic!</i>

04:40.860 --> 04:42.800
<i>Is she actually going to answer?!</i>

04:42.800 --> 04:47.100
My wish is to have 
never met you in the first place.

04:47.100 --> 04:50.180
Being with you is super stressful.

04:52.210 --> 04:54.750
<i>Angels sure are terrifying!</i>

04:54.750 --> 04:57.530
<i>He was trying to put up with </i>her<i>?!</i>

04:59.120 --> 05:00.400
<i>The counter-attack?!</i>

05:00.400 --> 05:04.810
You didn't have to say it like that.

05:02.690 --> 05:05.900
<b>Sob</b>

05:02.690 --> 05:05.900
<b>Sob</b>

05:04.810 --> 05:06.400
<i>He's so sensitive!</i>

05:06.400 --> 05:10.510
I know it couldn't have worked.

05:10.510 --> 05:12.200
<i>He's actually admitting it.</i>

05:12.200 --> 05:13.700
<i>He's still not done?!</i>

05:13.700 --> 05:15.470
I can't hear you.

05:15.470 --> 05:18.400
If you have something to say, say it clearly.

05:18.400 --> 05:20.280
Now look what you've done.

05:20.280 --> 05:22.130
I'm even more stressed out.

05:22.130 --> 05:23.630
Stop!

05:23.630 --> 05:25.630
<i>You're going to break!</i>

05:25.630 --> 05:27.380
<i>Why are you doing this?!</i>

05:27.690 --> 05:29.390
<i>Wait... is it for my sake?</i>

05:29.390 --> 05:30.600
<i>That's right...</i>

05:30.370 --> 05:34.170
Haiku poem, tanka poem!

05:30.510 --> 05:34.680
<b>Haiku poem,
tanka poem</b>

05:30.600 --> 05:34.080
<i>He's had my back this whole time.</i>

05:34.080 --> 05:40.810
<i>And he continues to distract that terrifying 
angel so that she doesn't come after me!</i>

05:35.060 --> 05:37.540
Haiku poem, go *ie

05:35.270 --> 05:40.810
<b>Haiku poem,
go *ie</b>

05:43.170 --> 05:44.070
<i>I see...</i>

05:44.070 --> 05:46.810
<i>So that's what it means...</i>

05:46.810 --> 05:48.390
<i>The one who learned love...</i>

05:48.790 --> 05:50.370
<i>The one who received love...</i>

05:50.370 --> 05:53.370
<i><b>Tremble</b></i>

05:50.720 --> 05:53.370
I can hardly even stand.

05:53.370 --> 05:55.620
I can't take any more. Mercy...

05:55.620 --> 05:57.560
You've done enough.

05:58.120 --> 06:00.540
Thanks for doing all this for me.

06:00.540 --> 06:02.130
It's enough.

06:02.130 --> 06:05.800
I don't want you to suffer anymore!

06:06.160 --> 06:08.380
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

06:12.010 --> 06:21.400
I can't
stand this.

06:12.180 --> 06:13.640
I can't stand this.

06:13.390 --> 06:21.400
Get me
the heck
out of
here.

06:13.640 --> 06:16.590
Get me the heck out of here.

06:16.590 --> 06:20.100
You two can enjoy each other's 
company without me.

06:16.890 --> 06:21.400
You
two
can
enjoy

06:18.640 --> 06:21.400
each
other's
company
without
me.

06:20.100 --> 06:21.400
Amane

06:21.770 --> 06:25.450
All right, I'll have you
confess your sins to me.

06:25.450 --> 06:28.450
What are you looking for and why?

06:28.450 --> 06:30.890
I've been looking for a book.

06:30.890 --> 06:32.640
But I couldn't find it.

06:32.640 --> 06:33.240
A book?

06:33.240 --> 06:35.560
I've always been a loner.

06:35.560 --> 06:37.820
No one's ever cared about me.

06:38.250 --> 06:43.790
One day, I learned of something called 
spats, which give you a beautiful figure.

06:38.330 --> 06:43.790
Shapely legs

06:38.330 --> 06:43.790
All
you
need!

06:43.790 --> 06:48.800
At first, I was happy just looking 
at women in spats in books.

06:43.790 --> 06:48.800
Beautiful Legs
Beautiful Butts

06:49.150 --> 06:53.370
So you couldn't help 
but attack women in spats...

06:53.370 --> 06:57.690
No, well, I thought they were wearing 
spats, but they were leggings...

06:57.690 --> 06:58.760
What the hell is he talking about?

06:58.760 --> 07:00.810
I don't even know the difference 
between spats and leggings.

07:00.810 --> 07:02.240
Very well.

07:02.240 --> 07:04.620
I'll take care of your sin.

07:04.620 --> 07:08.570
I shall guide you toward a state of purity.

07:13.600 --> 07:16.160
No one cared about me until now.

07:16.160 --> 07:19.790
You're the first one who's 
ever been kind to me.

07:21.060 --> 07:22.120
Thank you.

07:22.120 --> 07:24.380
You idiot, don't thank me!

07:25.450 --> 07:28.640
I only did it for myself!

07:29.880 --> 07:31.050
I...

07:31.470 --> 07:32.600
I...

07:41.010 --> 07:42.520
Wait, wait...

07:43.780 --> 07:46.540
Oh, it's so cute!

07:46.540 --> 07:49.040
You always find the cutest things, Amane-chan.

07:49.040 --> 07:51.240
Now, leave the rest to me.

07:52.060 --> 07:53.720
Bye!

07:54.530 --> 07:55.960
Sure.

07:57.750 --> 07:59.410
Hey, who was that?

07:59.410 --> 08:03.040
Kearney-san. The president of the dog-and-cat 
rescue volunteer organization.

07:59.410 --> 08:04.420
Meow Woof Meow

08:03.040 --> 08:04.420
No, I mean...

08:04.420 --> 08:07.720
You mean what I did to the demon, don't you?

08:07.720 --> 08:10.460
I sealed away his wicked thoughts and powers.

08:10.460 --> 08:11.300
Sealed?

08:11.300 --> 08:13.230
We seal away wicked thoughts,

08:13.230 --> 08:16.520
and if they are beasts, 
we let the organizations handle them.

08:16.520 --> 08:18.540
Though I don't know what we do with humanoids.

08:19.310 --> 08:22.280
I have no intention of taking demons' lives.

08:22.280 --> 08:24.600
Though I can't speak for the other angels.

08:25.190 --> 08:28.480
So what about that vicious scythe 
you were wrecking the concrete with?

08:28.480 --> 08:31.070
I was never going to hit him with it.

08:31.070 --> 08:33.950
The concrete was just an illusion, too.

08:33.950 --> 08:37.980
Besides, I was adjusting 
my power as I was fighting.

08:37.980 --> 08:40.830
Even if I'd hit him by accident, 
he wouldn't have had so much as a scrape.

08:41.830 --> 08:45.440
What? You don't seem convinced.

08:45.440 --> 08:51.120
What about the one you humiliated 
and exorcised slowly on the first day?

08:51.120 --> 08:52.460
That one?

08:52.460 --> 08:53.270
Here.

08:53.700 --> 08:54.590
What's this?

08:55.240 --> 08:56.960
Cute, right?

08:56.960 --> 09:00.620
I drew them on him in return 
for what he did to my cardigan.

09:00.620 --> 09:03.610
I'm told they helped him find 
a new owner right away.

09:03.610 --> 09:09.700
If you don't want me to draw eyebrows 
on you, you'd best not defy me.

09:09.700 --> 09:10.770
<i>Something's wrong.</i>

09:11.080 --> 09:13.450
<i>Are angels really like this?</i>

09:13.450 --> 09:16.070
<i>It's nothing like our intel said.</i>

09:16.070 --> 09:18.700
<i>Not only does she spare demons' lives,</i>

09:18.700 --> 09:21.240
<i>she takes pictures with them 
with </i>that<i> look on her face.</i>

09:22.190 --> 09:26.200
<i>But from the photos I saw before, 
what angels do is cruel.</i>

09:26.780 --> 09:28.500
<i>Or is she just....</i>

09:28.500 --> 09:33.380
Now, then, Akutsu, I'm running out of energy.

09:33.630 --> 09:35.090
<i>Is Amane just...</i>

09:36.850 --> 09:38.540
<i>Special?</i>

09:39.090 --> 09:40.970
Shall we go eat?

09:40.970 --> 09:42.240
I'll treat you.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.770
As a reward for your work.

09:45.700 --> 09:47.690
Sure, let's go.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.280
What?

09:49.280 --> 09:50.860
You look like you want to say something.

09:50.860 --> 09:51.900
Tell me.

09:51.900 --> 09:53.370
You've got me curious.

09:53.370 --> 09:54.360
I mean, you know.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.780
I always thought angels were cruel.

09:57.120 --> 09:59.780
So I'm a bit surprised that you're so kind.

10:00.820 --> 10:04.410
What, you <i>just</i> noticed that I'm kind?

10:04.330 --> 10:08.540
Hey, Hey

10:04.410 --> 10:05.990
You sure are dense.

10:06.640 --> 10:08.540
I was a fool for saying that.

10:08.540 --> 10:10.560
Yep, you're a fool.

10:10.560 --> 10:11.840
Now, let's go.

10:11.840 --> 10:12.540
Hey.

10:15.110 --> 10:16.920
<i>"Kind," huh?</i>

10:16.920 --> 10:20.170
<i>People say that about me 
when I'm in my normal state,</i>

10:20.170 --> 10:23.710
<i>but this is the first time anyone's said 
that to me when I showed my true form.</i>

10:23.710 --> 10:26.560
<i>He sure is a fool, though.</i>

10:27.560 --> 10:34.090
<i>His words are so silly, I don't even 
want to look at his face right now.</i>

10:34.090 --> 10:36.640
Hey, slow down a bit.

10:38.070 --> 10:39.570
W-Wait!

10:40.500 --> 10:43.550
You did good work for me.

10:43.550 --> 10:45.740
I figured I ought to reward you.

10:47.710 --> 10:49.340
Look at you, all worked up.

10:49.340 --> 10:51.230
You're adorable.

10:51.230 --> 10:52.210
Now...

10:52.540 --> 10:54.010
Wait, Amane!

10:59.910 --> 11:02.320
Morning, Akutsu-kun.

11:02.320 --> 11:04.100
Did you have a nice nap?

11:04.490 --> 11:08.180
You've got some nerve, 
falling asleep in my class.

11:04.600 --> 11:08.180
Daaaze

11:08.180 --> 11:09.820
Sh-Shiromura-sensei!

11:09.820 --> 11:11.580
Wait, no, stop!

11:11.580 --> 11:12.940
Kapow!

11:13.440 --> 11:15.860
<i>Ever since that day Amane 
and I went demon hunting,</i>

11:16.140 --> 11:18.510
<i>I've been having dreams about her.</i>

11:19.280 --> 11:23.320
<i>Come to think of it, my heart was pounding.</i>

11:24.560 --> 11:25.530
<i>No...</i>

11:25.530 --> 11:26.820
<i>No, no, no.</i>

11:25.530 --> 11:27.160
<b>Click</b>

11:26.030 --> 11:27.160
<b>Click</b>

11:26.700 --> 11:27.160
<b>Click</b>

11:27.160 --> 11:29.350
<i>There's no way </i>I<i> would, right?</i>

11:29.870 --> 11:32.830
<i>Me? Have romantic feelings?!</i>

11:33.240 --> 11:34.670
<i>Impossible.</i>

11:34.670 --> 11:36.500
<i>She's an enemy, too.</i>

11:36.500 --> 11:39.050
<i>And more than anything, she's...</i>

11:44.140 --> 11:49.190
Damn, she's really yanking my chain.

11:51.840 --> 11:53.480
Coming.

11:55.610 --> 11:57.420
You <i>finally</i> showed up!

11:55.610 --> 12:00.610
<i><b>Huff</b></i>

11:55.610 --> 12:00.610
<i><b>Puff</b></i>

11:57.420 --> 12:00.610
You shouldn't be lazy just because 
you don't have school!

12:03.660 --> 12:05.030
<i>Huff, puff</i>

12:04.480 --> 12:05.530
You <i>finally</i> showed—

12:06.400 --> 12:07.450
Sheesh.

12:07.450 --> 12:10.540
How could you slam the door 
on your own superior?

12:10.540 --> 12:12.230
Sorry, Department Chief Liz.

12:12.730 --> 12:14.570
So, what brings you here?

12:15.040 --> 12:17.850
It's about what I contacted you about recently.

12:15.040 --> 12:19.840
Akutsu

12:15.040 --> 12:19.840
Dear Akutsu-sama

12:15.040 --> 12:19.840
Dear Akutsu-sama,
There is something I'd like to bring to 
you in person for reasons of security. 
It's nothing to be suspicious of. 
Please and thank you.

12:17.850 --> 12:19.840
There's something I'd like to give you.

12:20.110 --> 12:21.920
And it's in that case?

12:21.920 --> 12:23.260
Not that.

12:24.260 --> 12:27.420
It's what I'm wearing right now.

12:27.420 --> 12:31.290
I'm told that there's a custom of changing 
one's wardrobe to match the season.

12:31.290 --> 12:33.230
I've brought a uniform for that occasion.

12:33.230 --> 12:34.810
Why did you have to wear it, though?

12:34.810 --> 12:37.060
And isn't that a girls' uniform?

12:39.650 --> 12:42.080
I'll be sending yours later.

12:42.080 --> 12:43.390
By priority mail.

12:43.390 --> 12:45.540
I'm pretty sure you just wanted to wear that.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.790
How is your mission coming?

12:49.790 --> 12:52.060
Have you come across anyone 
who might be right for the task?

12:52.450 --> 12:53.530
<i>My mission?</i>

12:53.530 --> 12:54.640
<i>Right.</i>

12:54.640 --> 12:57.750
<i>I came here to carry out a mission.</i>

12:58.400 --> 13:02.760
<i>Our world, Hell, is in danger.</i>

13:03.300 --> 13:09.890
<i>My boss decided to find someone 
charismatic to lead and motivate us.</i>

13:10.380 --> 13:13.770
<i>And I was ordered to carry out that search.</i>

13:14.280 --> 13:16.280
Er... Not quite.

13:16.280 --> 13:17.690
I see.

13:17.960 --> 13:20.480
You haven't found a single candidate, huh?

13:20.480 --> 13:21.360
Actually...

13:21.360 --> 13:26.120
I found someone who seemed fitting, 
but she's got some issues.

13:21.860 --> 13:32.910
<b>Fwahahaha</b>

13:24.860 --> 13:32.910
<b>Has some issues</b>

13:26.120 --> 13:28.780
She's attractive, 
but she's got a terrible personality.

13:28.110 --> 13:32.910
<b>Terrible personality</b>

13:28.780 --> 13:32.910
Perhaps I'm being picky, 
but I have quite a few concerns.

13:32.910 --> 13:34.090
I see.

13:34.090 --> 13:36.480
I understand why you'd be cautious.

13:36.480 --> 13:39.250
But please don't forget 
that we don't have time.

13:39.600 --> 13:42.190
I'll do my best to support your work.

13:42.190 --> 13:43.000
Right.

13:42.800 --> 13:44.090
<b>Whew</b>

13:44.090 --> 13:46.970
Well, shall we go to sleep?

13:46.970 --> 13:47.690
Huh?

13:48.560 --> 13:50.730
W-Wait, you're s-s-sleeping here?!

13:50.730 --> 13:53.180
Our department doesn't have a very big budget.

13:53.180 --> 13:55.050
Don't worry, though.

13:55.050 --> 13:56.980
I've brought everything I'll be needing.

13:56.980 --> 13:58.490
What is that, your sleepover kit?

13:59.100 --> 14:01.300
I'll be getting changed, now.

14:02.110 --> 14:03.860
<i>What am I supposed to do?</i>

14:03.860 --> 14:05.690
<i>This is all kinds of wrong.</i>

14:05.690 --> 14:09.750
<i>Hang on, is this one of those forbidden loves 
between an employee and his superior?</i>

14:10.230 --> 14:12.170
My dear little lamb...

14:12.170 --> 14:13.990
I'm an alpaca.

14:13.990 --> 14:15.130
Oh, no!

14:15.130 --> 14:16.500
This is bad!

14:17.800 --> 14:19.370
Is something the matter?

14:19.370 --> 14:22.010
<i>She's going to turn me into a man.</i>

14:21.380 --> 14:23.340
<b>Straw</b>

14:21.670 --> 14:23.340
<b>Bosses these days</b>

14:22.010 --> 14:23.340
Straw.

14:24.070 --> 14:26.860
I brought this with me.

14:26.860 --> 14:27.970
Yeah...

14:29.720 --> 14:30.220
<b>Insomnia</b>

14:30.220 --> 14:30.720
<b>Insomnia</b>

14:30.240 --> 14:32.120
I-I can't!

14:30.720 --> 14:31.220
<b>Insomnia</b>

14:31.220 --> 14:31.720
<b>Insomnia</b>

14:31.720 --> 14:32.220
<b>Insomnia</b>

14:32.120 --> 14:34.940
I can't eat all this!

14:32.220 --> 14:35.520
<b>Insomnia</b>

14:35.810 --> 14:37.760
It's so good, though...

14:37.760 --> 14:39.400
It's too delicious!

14:39.400 --> 14:40.970
<i>What kind of sleep talking is that?</i>

14:42.740 --> 14:45.230
We're going training after breakfast.

14:45.680 --> 14:47.070
Training?

14:47.550 --> 14:51.530
Hey, hey, miss, are you free?

14:51.530 --> 14:53.470
Wanna come with me and...

14:53.470 --> 14:55.530
Gross. No one said you could talk to me.

14:55.530 --> 14:59.040
Also, you've been going around 
chatting up all sorts of people.

14:59.040 --> 15:01.300
We aren't that easy.

15:02.680 --> 15:04.780
I don't wanna do this anymore!

15:02.880 --> 15:05.130
<b>I don't wanna
do this anymore</b>

15:04.780 --> 15:06.670
This is going nowhere.

15:06.670 --> 15:07.610
Um...

15:07.610 --> 15:10.030
How is this any kind of training?

15:10.030 --> 15:14.550
Even if you find an apt candidate, it won't 
matter if you can't bring them to Hell.

15:14.550 --> 15:18.970
Or are you confident that you 
can relay the details of their duties,

15:18.970 --> 15:22.210
convince them to take them on, 
<i>and</i> bring them to Hell?

15:22.210 --> 15:24.440
<i>I did try that on an angel.</i>

15:24.440 --> 15:26.800
Even if they agree to be something of an idol,

15:26.800 --> 15:28.940
it won't work if they're reluctant.

15:29.280 --> 15:32.970
We need them to consent to coming so that 
they can boost our morale effectively.

15:34.180 --> 15:35.440
Um...

15:35.440 --> 15:38.650
I've been looking for my dog 
since the day before yesterday.

15:39.750 --> 15:42.670
I don't think I've seen it.

15:42.670 --> 15:45.980
I hate to impose...

15:46.800 --> 15:49.320
But would you please let me know 
if you see him?

15:49.320 --> 15:53.260
My sickly kid sister is so worried, 
she can't even eat.

15:54.440 --> 15:56.030
All right.

15:56.030 --> 15:57.800
I'll ask my friends, too.

15:57.800 --> 16:00.170
Could you please give me 
your contact information?

16:00.580 --> 16:01.890
Thank you very much!

16:02.220 --> 16:04.410
Please do let me know.

16:04.900 --> 16:07.900
I hope you find him soon.

16:08.350 --> 16:10.360
I'm sorry for lying.

16:11.060 --> 16:13.650
But I got her contact info!

16:13.650 --> 16:14.780
How did it go?

16:14.780 --> 16:17.210
That seemed quite promising.

16:17.210 --> 16:18.400
Good.

16:18.400 --> 16:20.660
The guilt is weighing on me, though.

16:20.660 --> 16:25.660
Warfare is about focusing 
all your might on a single spot.

16:25.660 --> 16:27.040
What are you talking about?

16:27.040 --> 16:30.460
You need to determine 
where best to focus your efforts.

16:30.460 --> 16:33.280
That woman earlier was walking her dog.

16:33.280 --> 16:37.920
There's a way in for every woman, not just her.

16:37.920 --> 16:39.450
You need to aim for that.

16:39.450 --> 16:42.440
That's how you'll grow.

16:42.440 --> 16:43.180
Right.

16:43.180 --> 16:44.730
So cute!

16:44.730 --> 16:45.920
Thank you!

16:45.920 --> 16:48.150
You're a kind young man.

16:48.150 --> 16:50.190
Let's move on.

16:48.150 --> 16:50.230
<i><b>Local Newspaper</b></i>

16:50.190 --> 16:53.070
Invite her to tea and spend some time with her.

16:53.650 --> 16:54.960
Hi, there.

16:54.960 --> 16:56.360
May I ask you something?

16:56.360 --> 16:57.560
Yes?

16:57.560 --> 16:59.580
Huh? It's Akutsu-kun.

16:59.580 --> 17:01.580
<i>Tanahashi!</i>

16:59.660 --> 17:01.580
<i>Aieeee</i>

17:01.980 --> 17:03.370
Whatcha doing?

17:03.370 --> 17:07.290
Don't tell me you're one of <i>those</i> guys.

17:03.620 --> 17:07.630
<b>Grin
grinning</b>

17:07.290 --> 17:09.150
No, well, I'm not trying 
to hit on you or anything.

17:09.150 --> 17:11.760
You <i>are</i> trying to hit on people!

17:10.760 --> 17:11.760
I'm not!

17:12.080 --> 17:13.320
Well, let's go, then.

17:13.320 --> 17:14.240
We're doing tea, right?

17:14.240 --> 17:15.130
You're buying.

17:15.130 --> 17:16.630
Huh? Yeah...

17:18.000 --> 17:19.780
That was a good sleep.

17:20.520 --> 17:23.140
Looks like I slept through a lot of my Sunday.

17:23.140 --> 17:25.720
Doesn't look like we'll have time 
to go demon hunting today.

17:25.720 --> 17:27.560
I guess I'll do the laundry.

17:27.560 --> 17:29.730
<b>Devil Chomp</b>

17:27.560 --> 17:29.730
<b>Cafe Until 6PM,
Bar Afterwards</b>

17:28.260 --> 17:29.730
Why here?

17:30.120 --> 17:33.490
Eh, I kinda wanted grown-up vibes.

17:33.770 --> 17:35.950
Here you are. Orange juice.

17:35.950 --> 17:37.740
Thank you very much.

17:37.740 --> 17:41.740
Does it really help the vibe if we're only 
drinking orange juice, though?

17:41.740 --> 17:43.750
G-Good point.

17:44.900 --> 17:47.470
So, Chief, what do I do now?

17:47.470 --> 17:49.320
<i>J-Just a moment!</i>

17:49.320 --> 17:50.840
<i>Not here!</i>

17:50.840 --> 17:52.130
<i>Wait... don't tell me...</i>

17:52.540 --> 17:53.820
<i>She's checking a book?!</i>

17:54.510 --> 17:55.100
<i>Damn it!</i>

17:55.100 --> 17:56.590
<i>I can't depend on my boss!</i>

17:56.590 --> 17:57.120
<i>This place is...</i>

17:57.120 --> 18:00.300
Oh yeah, so I've been wondering...

18:00.300 --> 18:02.350
Do you have a crush on Lily-chan?

18:02.930 --> 18:04.480
You hang out together a lot.

18:04.480 --> 18:06.180
No, there's no way.

18:06.180 --> 18:07.690
Are you sure?

18:07.690 --> 18:09.190
<i>Who is Lily-san?</i>

18:09.190 --> 18:10.690
<i>Now's not the time, Chief!</i>

18:10.690 --> 18:14.270
You think she's pretty cute, though, don't you?

18:14.270 --> 18:15.570
Of course...

18:18.570 --> 18:20.270
not.

18:20.270 --> 18:22.160
You're so obvious.

18:22.160 --> 18:25.120
Hey, I'll help you out 
if you ever need anything.

18:25.120 --> 18:27.750
What about you, then, Tanahashi?

18:27.750 --> 18:28.680
What about Hirota?

18:28.680 --> 18:30.510
Ah, Kensaku.

18:30.510 --> 18:34.880
I'm pushing pretty hard, but it's not easy.

18:37.460 --> 18:41.590
I guess being childhood friends 
doesn't really work.

18:41.590 --> 18:42.720
<i>This is it!</i>

18:42.720 --> 18:45.320
<i>This is when I need to 
say something thoughtful!</i>

18:45.320 --> 18:47.180
<i>Is there any advice I can give her?</i>

18:47.180 --> 18:48.020
<i>I know!</i>

18:48.020 --> 18:51.440
Listen, Tanahashi, warfare is about...

18:51.440 --> 18:52.480
Huh?

18:52.480 --> 18:54.030
<i>What was it?</i>

18:54.030 --> 18:55.440
<i>I can't remember!</i>

18:55.440 --> 19:00.640
Warfare is about focusing 
all your might on a single spot, right?

19:00.640 --> 19:02.520
That's Napoleon, isn't it?

19:03.140 --> 19:04.760
You're right.

19:04.760 --> 19:08.110
I've been the one pushing 
at him this whole time,

19:08.110 --> 19:10.480
but maybe I've been focusing 
on the wrong thing.

19:10.480 --> 19:12.420
Thanks. That's good advice.

19:12.420 --> 19:14.410
<i>It worked out!</i>

19:14.410 --> 19:17.420
<i>I don't know who Naporitan is, but thank you!</i>

19:17.840 --> 19:20.120
Not that I'm trying to return 
the favor for today,

19:20.120 --> 19:23.390
but if anything ever comes up 
with Lily-chan, I'll hear you out.

19:23.390 --> 19:25.280
R-Right.

19:25.280 --> 19:27.270
You're pretty cool, aren't you?

19:27.660 --> 19:28.770
I know, right?

19:29.050 --> 19:31.690
You aren't half bad, either, Akutsu-kun!

19:32.000 --> 19:33.630
<i>All right, next step!</i>

19:33.630 --> 19:36.300
<i>Invite her to a park at night.</i>

19:36.300 --> 19:37.190
Nope!

19:37.190 --> 19:39.230
<i>After a good conversation at a bar,</i>

19:39.230 --> 19:42.890
<i>she's no doubt looking to be alone 
with you at a park at night!</i>

19:42.890 --> 19:43.820
<i>Or so it says!</i>

19:43.820 --> 19:45.560
I'm not doing that in this situation!

19:45.950 --> 19:48.750
She has a crush on my guy friend.

19:48.750 --> 19:51.380
I can't possibly invite her 
to the park at night!

19:51.790 --> 19:55.430
Creep! Creep! Creep!

19:53.240 --> 19:56.540
My school life would be over if word got out!

19:56.540 --> 19:58.800
<i>Not carrying out orders
will affect your evaluation,</i>

19:58.800 --> 20:00.280
<i>even if it's just training.</i>

20:00.280 --> 20:01.470
Are you serious?!

20:01.470 --> 20:03.280
Look at the time.

20:03.280 --> 20:04.300
Let's get going.

20:04.300 --> 20:05.430
Hang on!

20:09.350 --> 20:10.800
S-Sorry.

20:10.800 --> 20:11.880
Hey...

20:14.160 --> 20:15.640
Do you have time...

20:18.170 --> 20:20.300
I fell asleep in the middle of laundry.

20:20.300 --> 20:21.780
I might have caught a cold.

20:22.140 --> 20:24.240
Maybe I should take a bath and warm up.

20:26.070 --> 20:26.990
Sorry about that.

20:26.990 --> 20:29.120
I don't mind.

20:29.120 --> 20:31.230
Although it embarrassed me.

20:32.290 --> 20:36.630
I won't tell anyone about today, though.

20:37.020 --> 20:38.620
I can go by myself from here.

20:38.620 --> 20:39.870
Thanks for everything today.

20:39.870 --> 20:41.350
See you at school tomorrow.

20:44.800 --> 20:46.520
Good work today.

20:46.520 --> 20:49.960
I'm almost out of time, 
so I'm thinking of heading home.

20:49.960 --> 20:50.930
I see.

20:51.280 --> 20:54.270
Sorry about the sudden visit.

20:54.570 --> 20:58.160
But I'm glad I got to see 
how you've been living your life.

20:58.160 --> 20:58.770
Right.

20:59.430 --> 21:01.650
There's just one thing...

21:02.710 --> 21:04.310
Do you have some time after?

21:04.310 --> 21:06.610
W-We mustn't, sir.

21:11.010 --> 21:12.730
Don't say that.

21:12.730 --> 21:13.540
It'll be all right.

21:16.040 --> 21:18.980
S-Sir?!

21:19.670 --> 21:21.640
I have no issue with your preferences,

21:21.640 --> 21:24.670
but I'm not sure that was appropriate 
in front of another woman.

21:24.670 --> 21:26.930
Please forget about that!

21:27.220 --> 21:28.220
<i>Damn it, Amane...</i>

21:28.220 --> 21:31.000
<i>What kind of timing was that?!</i>

21:31.000 --> 21:33.180
<i>Although, I guess she helped me out of a bind?</i>

21:33.180 --> 21:37.440
Please apply what you 
learned today going forward.

21:37.440 --> 21:40.940
I have faith that you'll complete your mission.

21:41.560 --> 21:44.150
Well, keep doing your best.

21:47.330 --> 21:49.020
<i>I'm exhausted.</i>

21:49.970 --> 21:53.290
<i>I spent all day getting 
jerked around by my boss.</i>

21:54.040 --> 21:57.670
<i>But thanks to that, 
I feel a little more confident.</i>

21:58.240 --> 22:03.960
<i>I'd like to get right to work, 
but first, I need to deal with her.</i>

22:04.580 --> 22:07.960
<i>I should give it another shot!</i>
